This repository contains code, selected index lists, teacher generations and
per-run results for the paper "A teacher's predictive entropy separates
fine-tuning data that repays training, but which end of it to take depends on
the corpus".

Copyright (c) 2026 Dinh-Hong Vu, Trong-Chi Duong, Anh-Cuong Le
Natural Language Processing and Knowledge Discovery Research Group,
Faculty of Information Technology, Ton Duc Thang University.


WHAT IS COVERED BY WHICH LICENCE

  code/ and figures/          MIT Licence, reproduced below.
  data/                       Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
                              (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

data/ holds per_run_accuracies.csv, the selected index lists in subsets/,
the gate thresholds and the teacher generations. The index lists are integer
indices into the public corpora named below; they contain no corpus text.


UPSTREAM MATERIAL, NOT REDISTRIBUTED HERE

Datasets. Each keeps its own licence and must be obtained from its source.
  GSM8K                 MIT
  MATH                  MIT
  ECQA                  Community Data Licence Agreement -- Sharing 1.0
  CommonsenseQA         MIT
  Orca-Math (200k)      MIT
  APE210K               see the dataset's own repository
  Knights and Knaves    see the dataset's own repository
Where a licence is listed above, it is the one the publisher states; users
should confirm it at the source before redistributing.

Models. Loaded from their publishers, not included here.
  Qwen1.5-1.8B, Qwen2-1.5B, Qwen2.5, Qwen3-4B-Base   Apache-2.0
  Llama-3.2-1B, Llama-3.2-3B                         Llama 3.2 Community Licence
  SmolLM2-360M                                       Apache-2.0
  Pythia-410M                                        Apache-2.0
